<title>GERMANY: D.Babcock slumps to loss in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>D.Babcock slumps to loss in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>OBERHAUSEN, Germany 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net		    loss 434	 vs     46 profit</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax		loss 400	 vs     83 profit</p>
<p>    Cash flow		   minus 279	 vs    251 plus</p>
<p>    Group writedowns		  200	 vs    199</p>
<p>    Group investment		  195	 vs    205</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders	 8,400	 vs  9,800</p>
<p>    Group sales		     8,700	 vs  8,300</p>
<p>    Group order book	     10,500	 vs 10,500</p>
<p>    Group workforce (30.9)     32,342	 vs 34,769</p>
<p>    Parent net		   loss 357	 vs     14 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German engineering group is Deutsche Babcock AG.</p>
<p>--Bonn newsroom +49 228 26097 150</p>
</text>
